      "baseline_diagnosis": "Progressive Multifocal Leukoencephalopathy (PML).\n\nThe MRI confirms multifocal demyelinating lesions without enhancement, which is pathognomonic for PML. Given your history of significant medical issues, I strongly suspect an underlying immunocompromised state, such as HIV or immunosuppressive therapy, which has predisposed you to this opportunistic infection. Do you have a history of HIV, organ transplant, or current use of immunosuppressive medications?",
